Description: build, decode, send and capture network packets
 pckt builds packets a layer at a time (Ethernet, VLAN, ARP, IPv4, IPv6,
 ICMP, ICMPv6, TCP, UDP, DHCP and DNS), chains the layers into a frame, and
 decodes frames back into layers. Lengths, checksums and protocol numbers
 left unset are computed when packing.
 .
 It includes its own libpcap binding, pckt.pcap, for sending and capturing.
